<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_font_bold ltx_title_document" style="font-size:173%;">Preventing Robotic Jailbreaking via Multimodal Domain Adaptation
</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">
<span id="id1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
<span class="ltx_tbody">
<span id="id1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="id1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">Francesco Marchiori<sup id="id1.1.1.1" class="ltx_sup"><span id="id1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">1</span></sup>, Rohan Sinha<sup id="id1.1.1.2" class="ltx_sup"><span id="id1.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">2,†</span></sup>, Christopher Agia<sup id="id1.1.1.3" class="ltx_sup"><span id="id1.1.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">2,†</span></sup>,
Alexander Robey<sup id="id1.1.1.4" class="ltx_sup"><span id="id1.1.1.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">3,†</span></sup>,</span></span>
<span id="id1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="id1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">George J. Pappas<sup id="id1.2.1.1" class="ltx_sup"><span id="id1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">4</span></sup>, Mauro Conti<sup id="id1.2.1.2" class="ltx_sup"><span id="id1.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">1,5</span></sup>, and Marco Pavone<sup id="id1.2.1.3" class="ltx_sup"><span id="id1.2.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">2,6</span></sup></span></span>
</span>
</span>
</span><span id="id2" class="ltx_note ltx_note_frontmatter ltx_thanks_contribution ltx_role_thanks"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">†</sup><span class="ltx_note_outer"><span class="ltx_note_content"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">†</sup><span class="ltx_note_type">thanks: </span><sup id="id2.1" class="ltx_sup">†</sup> Equal contribution.</span></span></span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
